{
  "_comment": [
    "Storyblok component schema — architecture.md §3/§4, visual design per",
    "docs/agent-prompt-editorial-portfolio.md (which overrides architecture.md §13).",
    "",
    "GENERATED component bundle. Edit src/components/blocks/<block>/*.json.",
    "Run npm run schema:bundle to rebuild. Two jobs:",
    "  1. `npm run generate:types` → src/lib/storyblok/generated.d.ts",
    "  2. push into Storyblok once the space exists:",
    "     npm run storyblok:push:dry-run, then npm run storyblok:push",
    "",
    "A human-readable version for building these in the Storyblok GUI is generated",
    "into docs/storyblok-schema.md by `npm run docs:schema`.",
    "",
    "Field-name note: the brief calls image_full's field `layout`; architecture.md §4",
    "calls it `width`, and the brief says spec names win. It is `width`."
  ],
